WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.500
Step 1: What Autopay is

2
00:00:02.500 --> 00:00:08.000
Quasaria Autopay: your down payment sits in an on-chain vault and earns (simulated) yield.

3
00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:14.218
Each demo month (5 minutes) the vault sweeps that yield to the lender as extra principal.

4
00:00:14.218 --> 00:00:21.725
You still pay every installment. The loan just ends sooner. Watch the live demo deal, no wallet needed.

5
00:00:21.725 --> 00:00:26.226
Testnet only: test tokens, simulated yield, illustrative figures. Not a loan offer.

